[{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0107","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0107.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2444","title":"Adobe Flash Player 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 10.3.183.10 之前版本存在通用跨站脚本（Universal XSS）漏洞。攻击者可构造特制 URL，诱使用户访问恶意网站，在用户浏览器中注入并执行任意 HTML 或脚本代码，从而以用户身份在任意网站上执行未授权操作。该漏洞影响 Windows、Mac OS X、Linux、Solaris 及 Android 平台，已在 2011 年 9 月被检测到在野利用。用户访问恶意链接即可触发，无需额外认证。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2444"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-09-22T03:38:38Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:20Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 10.3.183.10（Windows/Mac/Linux/Solaris）或 10.3.186.7（Android）及以上版本。由于 Adobe Flash Player 已于 2020 年底停止支持并终止分发，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 组件，并在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件，改用 HTML5 标准替代方案，从根本上消除此类风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2011/09/stable-channel-update_20.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-09/msg00025.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48308","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb11-26.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-1333.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14050","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15272","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2444.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2444","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2444","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2444","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2444","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b