，同时在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-09/msg00025.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48308","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb11-26.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-1333.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14096","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16268","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2429.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2429","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2429","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2429","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2429","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2429.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2429.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/81f67ee2f2329d45fd70316a977698f2177074cc/2011/CVE-2011-2429.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-2429","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2429.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0105.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0105.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0104","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0104.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2428","title":"Adobe Flash Player 逻辑错误远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 存在逻辑错误漏洞（CWE-20），远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页或打开特制的 Flash 文件触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行或浏览器崩溃。该漏洞影响 Windows、Mac OS X、Linux、Solaris 及 Android 平台上 10.3.183.10 之前版本（Android 为 10.3.186.7 之前），无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害严重。Adobe 已在安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2428"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-09-22T03:38:38Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:18Z","remediation":"升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 10.3.183.10 及以上版本（Windows/Mac/Linux/Solaris）或 10.3.186.7 及以上版本（Android）。由于 Flash Player 已停止维护，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 并迁移至 HTML5 标准，同时在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-09/msg00025.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48308","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb11-26.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-1333.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A13945","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16181","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2428.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2428","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2428","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2428","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2428","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2428.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2428.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/81f67ee2f2329d45fd70316a977698f2177074cc/2011/CVE-2011-2428.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-2428","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2428.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0104.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0103","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0103.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2427","title":"Adobe Flash Player ActionScript 虚拟机栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 10.3.183.10之前版本的ActionScript虚拟机（AVM）组件中存在基于栈的缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过构造特制的SWF文件，诱使用户在受影响浏览器中打开，触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响Windows、Mac OS X、Linux、Solaris及Android平台，CVSS评分9.3，危害等级严重。Adobe已在安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2427"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-09-22T03:38:38Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:18Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 10.3.183.10 或更高版本（Windows/Mac/Linux/Solaris）或 10.3.186.7 或更高版本（Android）。该漏洞在 AVM 组件中存在栈缓冲区溢出，攻击者可通过构造恶意 SWF 文件实现远程代码执行。如无法升级，可在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件或启用 click-to-play 机制，并避免访问不可信网站上的 Flash 内容。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-09/msg00025.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48308","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb11-26.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-1333.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14125","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15950","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2427.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2427","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2427","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2427","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2427","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2427.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2427.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/81f67ee2f2329d45fd70316a977698f2177074cc/2011/CVE-2011-2427.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-2427","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2427.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0103.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0102","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0102.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2426","title":"Adobe Flash Player AVM栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 在 ActionScript 虚拟机（AVM）组件中存在基于栈的缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过构造特制的 Flash 内容触发栈溢出，从而在受害者系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows、Mac OS X、Linux、Solaris 平台上版本低于 10.3.183.10 的 Flash Player，以及 Android 平台上版本低于 10.3.186.7 的 Flash Player。攻击者仅需诱使用户访问包含恶意 SWF 文件的网页即可触发，无需用户交互授权，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级为高危。Adobe 已于 2011 年 9 月发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议用户尽快升级至 10.3.183.10 及以上版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2426"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-09-22T03:38:38Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:18Z","remediation":"立即彻底卸载 Adobe Flash Player（该软件已于 2020 年 12 月 31 日终止支持，不再提供安全更新），使用 Adobe 官方卸载工具清理残留组件，并移除浏览器中的 Flash 插件。如业务依赖 Flash 内容，应尽快迁移至 HTML5、WebAssembly 或 WebGL 等现代替代技术方案。对于仍需运行遗留 Flash 应用的场景，建议在隔离网络环境中通过虚拟机运行，并禁止外网访问以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-09/msg00025.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48308","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb11-26.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-1333.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14070","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15366","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2426.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2426","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2426","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2426","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2426","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2426.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2426.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6627fbe158e9fca31f355d5243a197fbe6b8a60c/2011/CVE-2011-2426.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-2426","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2426.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0102.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0151","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0151.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2860","title":"Google Chrome 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 14.0.835.163 之前版本在处理表格样式时存在释放后使用漏洞，攻击者可通过构造包含恶意表格样式的网页，诱导用户访问触发释放后使用内存错误，导致浏览器崩溃拒绝服务，甚至可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 14.0.835.163 之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、可造成部分机密性/完整性/可用性影响。Google 已在 Chrome 14.0.835.163 版本中修复此漏洞，用户升级至该版本或更高版本即可修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2860"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-09-19T12:02:56Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:08Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Google Chrome 至 14.0.835.163 或更高版本（当前版本已远超该版本，建议直接升级至最新稳定版）。如无法立即升级，可暂时禁用 JavaScript 或使用浏览器扩展禁用表格样式渲染作为临时缓解措施，并避免访问不可信网站。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=93587","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2011/09/stable-channel-update_16.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://osvdb.org/75562","http://secunia.com/advisories/48274","http://secunia.com/advisories/48288","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026774","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/69887","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14499","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2860.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2860","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2860.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2860","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2860"