ia.com/advisories/48274","http://secunia.com/advisories/48288","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026774","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/69884","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14593","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2857.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2857","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2857.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2857","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2857","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3846f10533f33b6add488388e63fdc90a48d6484/2011/CVE-2011-2857.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2857.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2857.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2011-2857.yml","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-2857"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0150.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0149","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0149.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2855","title":"谷歌 Chrome 浏览器 样式表处理漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 14.0.835.163 之前版本在处理层叠样式表（CSS）令牌序列时存在缺陷，未能正确处理“陈旧节点”，导致远程攻击者可通过构造恶意 CSS 内容触发内存损坏，造成拒绝服务或可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Chrome 14.0.835.163 之前所有版本，CVSS 6.8 分（中高危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度中等、无需认证，可导致机密性、完整性、可用性部分受损。攻击者需诱导受害者访问包含恶意 CSS 的网页，通过浏览器渲染引擎解析特制 CSS 令牌序列触发漏洞。Google 已在 Chrome 14.0.835.163 版本中修复该漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2855"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-09-19T12:02:56Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:07Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 14.0.835.163 或更高版本。可通过 Chrome 菜单 → 帮助 → 关于 Google Chrome 自动检查更新并重启浏览器完成升级。若无法立即更新，可暂时禁用浏览器的 CSS 解析相关实验性功能（chrome://flags 中禁用实验性 CSS 特性），或使用浏览器扩展阻止加载不可信站点的 CSS 文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=92959","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2011/09/stable-channel-update_16.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://osvdb.org/75557","http://secunia.com/advisories/48274","http://secunia.com/advisories/48288","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026774","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/69882","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14485","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2855.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2855","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2855.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2855","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2855","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2855.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3846f10533f33b6add488388e63fdc90a48d6484/2011/CVE-2011-2855.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2855.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2011-2855.yml","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-2855"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0149.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0148","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0148.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2854","title":"Google Chrome  内存错误引用漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 核心浏览引擎中的 WebKit 组件存在 use-after-free 类型的内存引用漏洞，该漏洞源于在处理“ruby”标签（小注标记）及嵌套“table”样式时未能正确释放已分配的内存，导致指针悬空。当攻击者构造特定的 HTML 文件并诱导受害者访问时，可利用此漏洞实现任意代码执行或导致浏览器崩溃。该漏洞影响 Chrome 14.0.835.163 及更早版本，同时也同样影响基于 WebKit 的 Safari 浏览器（版本低于 5.1.4）。攻击者无需任何权限即可远程触发，操作简单，影响广泛，成功可能导致远程代码执行或系统完全控制。此外，攻击者还可能对 WebKit 的其他组件利用类似技术破坏浏览器的安全沙盒机制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2854"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-09-19T12:02:56Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:07Z","remediation":"直接升级 Google Chrome 到 14.0.835.163 或更高版本，通过 Windows Update 自动更新或下载安装最新稳定版本。如无法立即更新，可临时禁用 Chrome 中的 Ruby 和表格样式处理功能以降低利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=92651","http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=94800","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2011/09/stable-channel-update_16.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00000.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Mar/msg00003.html","http://osvdb.org/75556","http://secunia.com/advisories/48274","http://secunia.com/advisories/48288","http://secunia.com/advisories/48377","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026774","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/69881","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14691","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2854.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2854","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2854.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2854","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2854","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2854.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/04172aaf351a2efb5323c8604e2705a84576d722/2011/CVE-2011-2854.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2854.json","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/chromium-vulnerabilities/blob/777486cd3fbe37797200e30f01e0397b40338964/cves/CVE-2011-2854.yml","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-2854"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0148.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0147","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0147.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2847","title":"Google Chrome 文档加载器使用后释放漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 浏览器文档加载器存在 use-after-free 漏洞，影响版本低于 14.0.835.163。攻击者远程可通过精心 crafted 的文档触发漏洞，该漏洞源于对已释放内存的非法访问。利用此漏洞可能导致浏览器崩溃、拒绝服务，或可能允许执行任意代码。攻击者无需身份验证即可远程发起攻击。CVSS 评分 6.8，风险等级中高。该漏洞影响 Windows、Linux 等平台的用户，用户在访问恶意网页时可能受到攻击，攻击者可利用浏览器内核漏洞进一步控制受害者系统。","sev